BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Tech Events
UID:event_317131776@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T051909Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T140000
SUMMARY:Code with Asheville Open Project / Co-Work Day
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Tech Events\n## Details\n\nJoin us for our monthly p
 roject/co-working day! Bring your own project for co-working or jump in on
  an existing project. We can use all different kinds of support\, from ema
 iling to data entry to coding.\n\n**Location:**\nHi Wire Brewing - Biltmor
 e Village / Guajiro Cuban food truck\n2A Huntsman Pl\, Asheville\, NC 2880
 3\n\n**What to expect:**\n(Feel free to drop in when you can and leave whe
 n you need to.)\n\n* *11am*: Arrival and introductions. Say hi and catch u
 p with your Code with Asheville crew.\n* *11:15-11:30am*: Folks chat throu
 gh what they hope to accomplish for the day\, ask for help\, and divide in
 to small groups for certain projects. This is a great place to get plugged
  in if you're looking for a project to work on.\n* *11:30am*: We get to wo
 rk! Some of us stay in the main meeting chat room while we work\, others g
 o heads offline.\n* 1-2*pm*: Wrap up our work for that day until next time
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avltech/events/317131776/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261025T152046Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261025T152046Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
